    - key: mission.gridlock.name
      value: GRIDLOCK
    - key: mission.gridlock.next
      value: "Supply Line \u2014 awaiting mission content"
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.delivery
      value: Deliver relief and secure the hospital
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.delivery.body
      value: Keep the route clear. The relief truck must arrive, then the hospital
        must stay clear for 20 seconds.
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.site_a
      value: Clear work site A
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.site_a.body
      value: Move Fadi and a worker into site A. Keep hostiles away for 25 seconds
        of work.
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.site_b
      value: Clear work site B
    - key: mission.gridlock.objective.site_b.body
      value: Protect the crew at site B. Interrupted work resumes where it stopped.
    - key: mission.gridlock.relief.moving
      value: Relief truck en route
    - key: mission.gridlock.relief.waiting
      value: Relief truck waiting for a clear route
    - key: mission.gridlock.resources
      value: Relief vehicle and its fuel are supplied.
    - key: mission.gridlock.result.defeat
      value: RELIEF INTERRUPTED
    - key: mission.gridlock.result.success
      value: The service lane is open and the hospital has its supplies. The sabotage
        points toward a dormant substation.
    - key: mission.gridlock.result.victory
      value: HOSPITAL REACHED
    - key: mission.gridlock.reward.card
      value: "800 XP \xB7 4,000 Credits"
    - key: mission.gridlock.star.1
      value: Restore hospital access
    - key: mission.gridlock.star.2
      value: Fadi and both workers survive
    - key: mission.gridlock.star.3
      value: Finish in under 7 minutes
    - key: mission.gridlock.summary
      value: Protect Fadi and his road crew. Clear the service lane and escort relief
        supplies to the hospital.
    - key: mission.gridlock.time_limit
      value: TIME LIMIT
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.1.body
      value: Select a rifle squad, press Move, then tap site A. Keep the armed saboteurs
        away from the crew.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.1.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.1.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.1.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.1.title
      value: Secure the first work area
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.10.body
      value: The relief truck must remain at the hospital for twenty clear seconds.
        Leaving or a nearby hostile resets the hold.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.10.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.10.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.10.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.10.title
      value: Hold the hospital clear
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.2.body
      value: Select Fadi, press Move, then tap the marked work area.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.2.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.2.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.2.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.2.title
      value: Bring Fadi to site A
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.3.body
      value: Select a road worker and move them into the same work area as Fadi.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.3.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.3.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.3.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.3.title
      value: Bring a road worker
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.4.body
      value: Work needs Fadi, a living worker and no nearby hostile. Progress pauses
        during interruptions and resumes when it is safe.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.4.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.4.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.4.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.4.title
      value: Protect the work
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.5.body
      value: Move the rifles to site B before advancing the crew. Keep the cleared
        section protected too.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.5.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.5.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.5.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.5.title
      value: Secure the second work area
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.6.body
      value: Move Fadi into site B. The first cleared section stays open.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.6.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.6.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.6.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.6.title
      value: Move Fadi forward
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.7.body
      value: Move a surviving worker to Fadi at site B. Stop or retreat if the approach
        becomes unsafe.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.7.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.7.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.7.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.7.title
      value: Regroup the road crew
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.8.body
      value: Keep the crew safe for the remaining work. Losing one worker is recoverable;
        Fadi and one worker must survive.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.8.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.8.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.8.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.8.title
      value: Finish the hospital approach
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.9.body
      value: The supplied truck travels on the cleared route. Move the escorts near
        it. If the route is contested, secure the marked section so it can continue.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.9.diagram
      value: "SITE A \u2192 SITE B \u2192 RELIEF TRUCK \u2192 HOSPITAL"
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.9.example
      value: After a mistaken order, press Stop, reselect the intended unit, then
        press Move.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.9.mistake
      value: Fadi and the workers are unarmed. Secure their approach with the rifles
        first.
    - key: mission.gridlock.tutorial.9.title
      value: Protect relief transit
    - key: mission.gridlock.warning
      value: Saboteurs approaching the cleared section. Protect the crew and route!
    - key: mission.gridlock.work.clearing
      value: Removing obstruction
    - key: mission.gridlock.work.complete
      value: Route section cleared
    - key: mission.gridlock.work.crew_missing
      value: Fadi and a worker must be here
    - key: mission.gridlock.work.threat_nearby
      value: "Threat nearby \u2014 work paused"
    - key: mission.gridlock.work.working
      value: Working
    - key: mission.gridlock.worker.name
      value: Road worker
    - key: mission.guide.lesson_count
      value: '{0} lessons'
    - key: mission.m01.goal.civilians
      value: PROTECT CIVILIANS
    - key: mission.m01.goal.squad
      value: KEEP SQUAD SAFE
    - key: mission.m01.objective.protect_squad
      value: KEEP THE COMMAND SQUAD ALIVE
    - key: mission.m01.result.defeat
      value: The command squad was lost. Regroup and redeploy.
    - key: mission.m01.result.victory
      value: Hostile patrol neutralized. The Old Market corridor is secure.
    - key: mission.m01.reward.card
      value: 260 XP  |  1,200 CREDITS
    - key: mission.m01.summary
      value: Secure the Old Market corridor and protect the civilian route.
    - key: mission.m02.briefing.summary
      value: Reopen the abandoned JRC forward post before the Ash Line reaches it.
        Establish a foothold and prepare for incoming threats.
    - key: mission.m02.objective.build_forward_barracks
      value: Build the Barracks
    - key: mission.m02.objective.produce_rifle_squad
      value: Train one rifle squad
    - key: mission.m02.result.defeat
      value: The forward post fell before the defense was secured. Rebuild and redeploy.
    - key: mission.m02.result.first_clear
      value: Forward post operational. Dalia Rahim accepts field-lead duty. The clinic-route
        warning sector has gone dark.
    - key: mission.m02.result.identity
      value: 'M02 ESTABLISH THE BASE

        FORWARD POST'
    - key: mission.m02.result.incomplete
      value: The Barracks and rifle squad were not both ready. Retry to restore the
        post.
    - key: mission.m02.result.operational
      value: Barracks built and rifle squad trained. The forward post is operational.
    - key: mission.m02.result.replay
      value: Forward post defended. The clinic route remains under coalition control.
    - key: mission.m02.result.squads_recruited
      value: SQUADS RECRUITED
    - key: mission.m02.result.subtitle
      value: "ESTABLISH THE BASE \u2022 FORWARD POST"
    - key: mission.m02.reward.barracks_unlock
      value: BARRACKS UNLOCK
    - key: mission.m02.reward.card
      value: 320 XP  |  1,500 CREDITS  |  BARRACKS UNLOCK
    - key: mission.m02.summary
      value: Reopen an abandoned forward post before a second hostile cell reaches
        it.
    - key: mission.m03.access
      value: "Two rifle squads \xB7 Ground Radar Tank"
    - key: mission.m03.action.continue
      value: CONTINUE
    - key: mission.m03.action.do_it
      value: DO IT
    - key: mission.m03.action.restore_hold
      value: Hold position
    - key: mission.m03.action.skip
      value: SKIP OPTIONAL STEP
    - key: mission.m03.action.wait
      value: "Defending\u2026"
    - key: mission.m03.action.warning
      value: Read warning
    - key: mission.m03.build.choose_one
      value: 'Choose ONE defense: a Road Barrier across the road, or a Guard Tower
        beside it.'
    - key: mission.m03.camera.opening
      value: "MISSION OVERVIEW\nYour defenders and the convoy approach. ARIA\u2019s
        tutorial starts after this overview."
    - key: mission.m03.camera.return
      value: RETURN VIEW
    - key: mission.m03.camera.skip
      value: Return to command view
    - key: mission.m03.camera.victory
      value: 'POST SECURED

        Both convoy elements stopped. Your defense held.'
    - key: mission.m03.casualties
      value: "SQUAD LOSSES: {0} \xB7 Reinforce from your Barracks"
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.brief
      value: 'Your mission: stop BOTH enemy convoys before they reach the post. Keep
        the post standing. First prepare your rifles; the convoy waits while you
        learn. Read the warning, then Continue.'
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.engage
      value: 'Enemy vehicles are approaching. Keep rifles on Hold at the yellow ring:
        they fire automatically when enemies enter range. Stop every vehicle before
        the post. Another scan is not required.'
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.hold
      value: Press Hold now. Your rifles will fire automatically at vehicles in range
        without chasing them. Protect the road to the post.
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.main
      value: Stop the remaining convoy
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.move
      value: Press Move, then tap the marked position beside the road. Your rifles
        must cover the convoy route, not wait at the barracks.
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.moving
      value: Your rifles are moving to the defensive line. Wait for their arrival;
        then press Hold. The yellow ring marks the destination. Radar recharge does
        not stop the mission.
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.prepare
      value: First prepare a defensive line beside the marked road. Open Build to
        see your options. In the next lesson, choose ONE tower or road barrier, or
        skip building. You do not need all three buildings.
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.radar
      value: "Optional: press the existing Scan button to check your radar vehicle\u2019s
        coverage. It confirms nearby enemy vehicles; it does not attack. Two scans
        are available, 60 seconds apart. You can skip this lesson and keep defending
        without scanning."
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.select
      value: Tap Select defenders in ARIA. Your goal is to stop both convoys before
        they reach the post. Radar recharge is optional; keep defending.
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.vanguard
      value: Stop the first convoy
    - key: mission.m03.clarity.wait
      value: Defense is ready. Keep your rifles here on Hold and wait for the convoy;
        no extra click is needed. The yellow ring marks the road to defend. The warning
        estimates enemy arrival.
