      value: COMMON MISTAKE
    - key: mission.m03.guide.next
      value: Next
    - key: mission.m03.guide.no_match
      value: No matching class
    - key: mission.m03.guide.open
      value: Field guide
    - key: mission.m03.guide.pause
      value: "Battle paused \xB7 Close to resume"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.previous
      value: Previous
    - key: mission.m03.guide.radio
      value: RADIO ARCHIVE
    - key: mission.m03.guide.reference_notice
      value: "Reference values come from the class configuration. Availability, production
        price and squad size are shown by the current mission\u2019s production panel."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.role.armed
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Armed unit. Range and damage are configuration values; position
        and confirmed targets determine whether it can contribute."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.role.protected
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Protected civilian. Keep combat away from them to preserve
        the civilian bonus star."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.role.sensor
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Ground reconnaissance. Keep the unarmed sensor safe; it provides
        warning information, not firepower."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.role.transport
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Transport. Passenger capacity does not guarantee an onboard
        weapon. In M3 the enemy carrier can breach the core even without firing."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.role.unarmed
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Support. This configuration cannot attack. Do not count it
        as a defensive weapon."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.scroll
      value: Scroll to read the example and common mistake
    - key: mission.m03.guide.search
      value: "Search classes\u2026"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.stats
      value: "Health {0} \xB7 Speed {1}\nAttack {2} \xB7 Range {3}\nGround sensor
        {4} \xB7 Air sensor {5}\nPassenger seats {6} \xB7 Vehicle capacity {7}"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.title
      value: "FIELD GUIDE \xB7 RADAR WARNING"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.1.body
      value: Stop every registered hostile while keeping the post standing and the
        inner core clear.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.1.diagram
      value: "WEST ROAD \u2192 DEFENSE \u2192 FORWARD POST"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.1.example
      value: If the fast carrier survives the firefight, block or intercept it before
        it reaches the post core.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.1.mistake
      value: Treating civilian losses as an automatic mission defeat. They affect
        a bonus star.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.1.title
      value: Your mission
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.10.body
      value: Keep one squad covering the inner approach while another intercepts
        farther west.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.10.diagram
      value: FORWARD INTERCEPTION + INNER COVERAGE
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.10.example
      value: If a forward squad falls back, move your reserve into the approach before
        the carrier passes the last turn.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.10.mistake
      value: Chasing a target until every defender leaves the post approach.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.10.title
      value: Protect the core
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.11.body
      value: After victory, review the civilian and undamaged-post stars separately;
        retry for a better defense.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.11.diagram
      value: VICTORY + CIVILIANS SAFE + POST UNDAMAGED
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.11.example
      value: A damaged post can still win. Afterward, the result explains which bonus
        stars were missed and why.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.11.mistake
      value: Expecting first-clear unlocks to be granted again on replay.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.11.title
      value: Stars and retry
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.12.body
      value: Search the 57 class identities and compare their actual configured capabilities.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.12.diagram
      value: "FRIENDLY \xB7 HOSTILE \xB7 PROTECTED \xB7 REFERENCE \xB7 FUTURE"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.12.example
      value: "Search Radar Tank, compare its ground-sensor range with the Air Radar
        Dish, then check each card\u2019s availability label."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.12.mistake
      value: Assuming every reference class is available for production in M3.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.12.title
      value: Every class
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.2.body
      value: Read the source before acting on a reported position.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.2.diagram
      value: "SCOUT REPORT \u2192 SENSOR CONTACT \u2192 VISUAL CONFIRMATION"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.2.example
      value: A scout warning gives an approach and an estimate. Read it, inspect
        the road, then check for sensor confirmation.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.2.mistake
      value: Assuming an estimated arrival time is a guaranteed countdown.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.2.title
      value: Read a warning
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.3.body
      value: A Ground Radar Tank detects ground vehicles; the Air Radar Dish is for
        air contacts.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.3.diagram
      value: "REPORTED \u2260 CONFIRMED \xB7 STALE \u2260 DESTROYED"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.3.example
      value: 'A vehicle leaves radar coverage: its last reported position stays useful,
        but it is no longer a live location.'
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.3.mistake
      value: Interpreting a lost or stale contact as a destroyed enemy.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.3.title
      value: Sources and confidence
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.4.body
      value: Inspect the road, return to your squad, then issue Move if repositioning
        is needed.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.4.diagram
      value: "JUMP \u2192 CAMERA \xB7 MOVE \u2192 SELECTED UNITS"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.4.example
      value: Keep squad A selected, inspect the warning with Jump, then press Move
        and choose a reachable roadside position.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.4.mistake
      value: "Expecting the camera\u2019s Jump button to move a squad."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.4.title
      value: Jump and Move
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.5.body
      value: A completed Tower adds firepower. A Barrier can change the route; keep
        a second approach covered.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.5.diagram
      value: "CHECK COST \u2192 VALID FOOTPRINT \u2192 CONFIRM \u2192 COMPLETION"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.5.example
      value: Begin a Tower early and cover its construction with rifles. Place a
        Barrier only where you can cover the detour.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.5.mistake
      value: Spending on an unfinished defense while leaving the approach unguarded.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.5.title
      value: Tower and Barrier
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.6.body
      value: Use the existing Barracks to order a four-person rifle squad when the
        displayed budget allows.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.6.diagram
      value: "BARRACKS \u2192 PRODUCTION \u2192 FOUR RIFLES \u2192 POSITION"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.6.example
      value: Select the completed Barracks and order one rifle squad. Wait for all
        four to arrive before counting them in your defense.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.6.mistake
      value: "Reading a single class\u2019s reference cost as the current mission\u2019s
        squad transaction."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.6.title
      value: Rifle reinforcements
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.7.body
      value: Hold keeps units defending in place. To cancel orders and stop automatic
        fire, select units, open Commands, and tap Cease Fire. Use Hold to defend
        again.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.7.diagram
      value: "HOLD \u2192 DEFEND \xB7 COMMANDS \u2192 CEASE FIRE"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.7.example
      value: After reaching the roadside, use Hold. To change destination, issue
        a new Move order.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.7.mistake
      value: Cease Fire does not pause the battle. Use Pause when you need time to
        read.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.7.title
      value: Hold and Cease Fire
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.8.body
      value: "Scan checks the living radar\u2019s coverage. An empty result means
        no ground vehicle was detected there. You can save Scan for the convoy warning."
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.8.diagram
      value: "2 USES \xB7 60s COOLDOWN \xB7 GROUND SENSOR COVERAGE"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.8.example
      value: 'A confirmed vehicle is nearby: use Scan once to refresh its position.
        Save the remaining use for the main element.'
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.8.mistake
      value: Expecting an empty scan to refund its charge or reveal the whole map.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.8.title
      value: Scan
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.9.body
      value: Shoot a confirmed armed car; also intercept the unarmed carrier before
        it reaches the core.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.9.diagram
      value: "ARMED CAR \u2192 DAMAGE \xB7 CARRIER \u2192 CORE BREACH"
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.9.example
      value: Concentrate rifle fire on the armed car, but keep a reserve between
        the carrier and the post.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.9.mistake
      value: Ignoring an unarmed enemy vehicle because it cannot shoot.
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topic.9.title
      value: Choose targets
    - key: mission.m03.guide.topics
      value: 12 lessons
    - key: mission.m03.guide.unarmed
      value: Unarmed
    - key: mission.m03.guide.unavailable_stats
      value: Gameplay statistics will appear when this class has a playable configuration.
    - key: mission.m03.jump
      value: JUMP TO REPORT
    - key: mission.m03.label.forces
      value: STARTING FORCES
    - key: mission.m03.label.options
      value: DEFENSE CHOICES
    - key: mission.m03.location
      value: "Western approach \xB7 JRC forward post"
    - key: mission.m03.name
      value: Radar Warning
    - key: mission.m03.objective.hold_post
      value: Keep the forward post standing
    - key: mission.m03.objective.keep_core_clear
      value: Prevent a breach of the inner core
    - key: mission.m03.objective.prevent_breach
      value: Prevent a breach of the inner core
    - key: mission.m03.objective.protect_post
      value: Keep the forward post standing
    - key: mission.m03.objective.stop_convoy
      value: Stop both convoy elements
    - key: mission.m03.optional.skip
      value: Skip optional lesson
    - key: mission.m03.options
      value: Tower, Barrier or rifle reinforcements
    - key: mission.m03.order.holding
      value: Holding position
    - key: mission.m03.ping.cooldown
      value: Ready in {0}s
    - key: mission.m03.ping.empty
      value: No uses remaining
    - key: mission.m03.ping.label
      value: Scan
    - key: mission.m03.ping.no_sensor
      value: Ground sensor unavailable
    - key: mission.m03.ping.paused
      value: Paused
    - key: mission.m03.ping.ready
      value: "Scan \xB7 {0} uses"
    - key: mission.m03.ping.recharging_label
      value: Radar recharge
    - key: mission.m03.ping.requested
      value: Radar sweep requested.
    - key: mission.m03.ping.spent_label
      value: Radar used up
    - key: mission.m03.prepare
      value: "PREPARATION \xB7 Position your defenders, then press Hold to begin
        the defense."
    - key: mission.m03.prepare.progress
      value: Position your defenders, then press Hold
    - key: mission.m03.prepare.short
      value: "PREPARATION \xB7 Enemy advance is paused"
    - key: mission.m03.radar.description
      value: Ground radar vehicle that detects approaching enemy ground vehicles
        but cannot attack.
    - key: mission.m03.resources
      value: "50,000 Credits \xB7 100 Materials"
    - key: mission.m03.result.breach
      value: A living hostile reached the inner core. Intercept the carrier before
        the final turn; an unarmed vehicle can still breach.
    - key: mission.m03.result.civilian_goal
      value: CIVILIAN SAFETY
    - key: mission.m03.result.civilians
      value: CIVILIANS LOST
    - key: mission.m03.result.damaged
      value: DAMAGED
    - key: mission.m03.result.defeat
      value: MISSION FAILED
    - key: mission.m03.result.destroyed
      value: DESTROYED
    - key: mission.m03.result.enemies
      value: HOSTILES STOPPED
    - key: mission.m03.result.incomplete
      value: INCOMPLETE
    - key: mission.m03.result.integrity
      value: A required mission actor became unavailable. Restart this attempt; no
        victory or rewards were granted.
    - key: mission.m03.result.losses
      value: LOSSES
    - key: mission.m03.result.no_reward
      value: NO REWARD
    - key: mission.m03.result.objectives
      value: DEFENSE & BONUS STARS
    - key: mission.m03.result.performance
      value: PERFORMANCE
    - key: mission.m03.result.post
      value: FORWARD POST CONDITION
    - key: mission.m03.result.post_lost
      value: The forward post was destroyed. Cover its approach and keep a reserve
        for the next attempt.
    - key: mission.m03.result.radar_saved
      value: Post secured without radar. Tools are optional; stars reward protection.
    - key: mission.m03.result.radar_used
      value: Post secured. Radar revealed the approach early. Stars reward civilian
        and post protection.
    - key: mission.m03.result.retry
      value: RETRY
    - key: mission.m03.result.rewards
      value: REWARDS
    - key: mission.m03.result.safe
      value: ALL SAFE
    - key: mission.m03.result.squad_losses
      value: RIFLES LOST
    - key: mission.m03.result.stars
      value: '{0} / 3 STARS'
    - key: mission.m03.result.stopped
      value: STOPPED
    - key: mission.m03.result.undamaged
      value: UNDAMAGED
    - key: mission.m03.result.victory
      value: VICTORY
    - key: mission.m03.result.victory_body
      value: Both convoy elements stopped. The forward post is standing and the inner
        core held. Review the civilian and post-damage stars below.
    - key: mission.m03.reward.guard_tower
      value: Guard Tower access
    - key: mission.m03.reward.radar_ping
      value: Radar-assisted Scan access
    - key: mission.m03.reward.unlocks
      value: TOWER + RADAR-ASSISTED SCAN
    - key: mission.m03.save.body
      value: Defense complete. Progress and rewards could not be saved. Retry saving
        before leaving this mission.
    - key: mission.m03.save.failed
      value: PROGRESS NOT SAVED
    - key: mission.m03.save.pending
      value: Rewards pending save
    - key: mission.m03.save.retry
      value: RETRY SAVE
    - key: mission.m03.scan.contact_result
      value: 'Scan: {0} vehicles. Keep holding.'
    - key: mission.m03.scan.empty_result
      value: 'Scan: no vehicles. Keep holding.'
    - key: mission.m03.star.civilians_safe
      value: All four civilians survived
    - key: mission.m03.star.complete
      value: Stop the convoy and hold the post
    - key: mission.m03.star.post_undamaged
      value: Forward post took no damage
    - key: mission.m03.summary
      value: Hold the forward post against two convoy elements. Position your squads,
        read the warnings, and choose how to reinforce the defense.
    - key: mission.m03.tactics.build
      value: A tower adds fixed defensive fire; a barrier blocks a road. Spend materials
        to cover an approach, or save them for rifle reinforcements.
    - key: mission.m03.tactics.radar
      value: Radar confirmed the approach early. Your remaining charges can be saved
        for the next wave.
    - key: mission.m03.tactics.visual
      value: Visual contact confirms nearby threats for free. Radar trades a limited
        charge for earlier information.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.1.body
      value: Check the source, route and contact estimate. A scout report does not
        confirm the convoy's size.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.1.title
      value: Read the warning
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.10.body
      value: The armed cars can damage your defense. The unarmed carrier can still
        breach the core. Choose targets you have confirmed.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.10.title
      value: Prioritize confirmed threats
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.11.body
      value: Read the second warning and check your surviving squads. Reposition
        if needed while keeping the approach to the post covered.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.11.title
      value: Adapt to the main convoy
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.12.body
      value: Stop every enemy vehicle. Keep rifles on Hold and cover the core. Protect
        civilians and the post for bonus stars.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.12.title
      value: Defend the post
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.2.body
      value: Jump to the reported road. This moves the camera and keeps your squads
        and orders unchanged.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.2.title
      value: Inspect the approach
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.3.body
      value: Defend forward for more interception time, or stay near the post. Keep
        the inner approach covered.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.3.title
      value: Choose your defense
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.4.body
      value: Choose ONE Road Barrier or Guard Tower. Place the barrier across the
        road; place the tower off the road. Rotate if needed, then confirm a green
        footprint. One placement completes this optional lesson.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.4.title
      value: 'Optional: build a defense'
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.5.body
      value: Select a friendly squad, press Move, then choose a reachable position
        beside the convoy road. Wait for arrival.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.5.title
      value: Position your rifle squads
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.6.body
      value: Select the squad and press Hold. It defends its position and fires at
        enemies in range without chasing them.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.6.title
      value: Hold the line
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.7.body
      value: Keep your rifles on Hold. They defend in place and fire automatically;
        no further click is needed.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.7.title
      value: Keep defending
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.8.body
      value: Scan scans the living Ground Radar Tank's coverage. Two uses, with a
        cooldown between them. An empty scan still uses a charge.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.8.title
      value: Refresh your information
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.9.body
      value: Open the completed Barracks' rifle production. Confirm the displayed
        cost for a four-person squad. Construction and production remain your choice.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.9.title
      value: 'Optional: reinforce'
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.resume.body
      value: Cease Fire disabled automatic fire. Keep the squad selected and press
        Hold to defend again. This lesson finishes after Hold is active.
    - key: mission.m03.tutorial.resume.title
      value: Restore your defense
    - key: mission.m03.warning.compact.count
      value: '{0} vehicles'
    - key: mission.m03.warning.compact.eta
      value: 'Arrival: {0}s'
    - key: mission.m03.warning.compact.first
      value: "First convoy \xB7 western road"
    - key: mission.m03.warning.compact.main
      value: "Main convoy \xB7 western road"
    - key: mission.m03.warning.compact.unknown
      value: Unconfirmed
    - key: mission.m03.warning.eta
      value: 'Contact estimate: {0}s'
    - key: mission.m03.warning.jump
      value: Inspect reported position
    - key: mission.m03.warning.main
      value: "Main convoy \xB7 western road"
    - key: mission.m03.warning.ping
      value: Scan
    - key: mission.m03.warning.resolved
      value: Convoy element stopped
    - key: mission.m03.warning.scout
      value: Scout report
    - key: mission.m03.warning.sensor
      value: Ground radar
    - key: mission.m03.warning.stale
      value: Last known contact
    - key: mission.m03.warning.title
      value: CONVOY WARNING
    - key: mission.m03.warning.unknown
      value: Composition unconfirmed
    - key: mission.m03.warning.vanguard
      value: "Vanguard \xB7 western road"
    - key: mission.m03.warning.vehicles
      value: '{0} vehicle(s) observed'
    - key: mission.m03.warning.visual
      value: Visual contact
    - key: mission.m03.warning.window
      value: Contact window open
    - key: mission.m04.access
      value: "8 rifles \xB7 APC \xB7 helicopter \xB7 4 specialists"
    - key: mission.m04.action.passengers
      value: Open passengers
    - key: mission.m04.camera.opening
      value: 'RESCUE ROUTE

        Reviewing the pickup and landing areas. ARIA
        starts when the camera returns.'
    - key: mission.m04.camera.victory
      value: 'AIRLIFT COMPLETE

        All four specialists are safe. Laila is departing.'
    - key: mission.m04.enemy_intel
      value: A western patrol moves 15 seconds after boarding, or after two minutes.
    - key: mission.m04.focus.departure
      value: DEPARTURE
    - key: mission.m04.focus.landing
      value: LANDING AREA
    - key: mission.m04.focus.team
      value: TEAM
    - key: mission.m04.guide.availability.0
      value: Friendly in M4
    - key: mission.m04.guide.availability.1
      value: Hostile in M4
    - key: mission.m04.guide.availability.2
      value: Protected specialist in M4
    - key: mission.m04.guide.availability.3
      value: "Reference only \xB7 unavailable in M4"
    - key: mission.m04.guide.notice
      value: Use the supplied escorts, APC and helicopter. Reinforcements are unavailable
        in this mission.
    - key: mission.m04.guide.reference
      value: "Reference only \xB7 unavailable in M4"
    - key: mission.m04.guide.role.protected
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Protected specialist. All four must ride the APC, transfer
        to the helicopter and leave alive. Losing anyone fails the rescue."
    - key: mission.m04.guide.role.transport
      value: "ROLE \xB7 Transport. Passenger capacity does not imply an onboard weapon.
        Use the APC for the road leg, unload at the landing area and board all four
        specialists onto the helicopter."
    - key: mission.m04.guide.title
      value: "FIELD GUIDE \xB7 AIRLIFT"
    - key: mission.m04.hud.aboard
      value: SPECIALISTS ABOARD
    - key: mission.m04.hud.carrier
      value: APC TRANSFER
    - key: mission.m04.hud.cleared
      value: CLEARED FOR DEPARTURE
    - key: mission.m04.hud.contested
      value: LANDING AREA CONTESTED
    - key: mission.m04.hud.remaining
      value: TIME REMAINING
    - key: mission.m04.hud.route
      value: "APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 DEPARTURE"
    - key: mission.m04.hud.secure
      value: LANDING AREA CLEAR
    - key: mission.m04.hud.status
      value: "Aboard {0}/4 \xB7 APC leg {1}/4 \xB7 Clear {2}/20s \xB7 {3}s left"
    - key: mission.m04.location
      value: "Eastern district \xB7 medical landing area"
    - key: mission.m04.name
      value: AIRLIFT
    - key: mission.m04.objective.extract
      value: Extract all four specialists
    - key: mission.m04.objective.extract.body
      value: "APC \u2192 helicopter \u2192 departure zone; every specialist must
        survive."
    - key: mission.m04.objective.landing
      value: Hold the landing area clear for 20 seconds
    - key: mission.m04.objective.landing.body
      value: All four aboard; keep the helicopter inside the clear landing area.
    - key: mission.m04.objective.transport
      value: Protect the APC and helicopter
    - key: mission.m04.objective.transport.body
      value: Keep the APC until transfer and the helicopter through departure.
    - key: mission.m04.options
      value: Cover the approach, board safely, leave together
    - key: mission.m04.patrol.active
      value: "Enemy patrol advancing \xB7 Protect the team"
    - key: mission.m04.patrol.warning
      value: Enemy patrol moves in {0}s
    - key: mission.m04.resources
      value: Mission-supplied APC and helicopter
    - key: mission.m04.result.aircraft_lost
      value: The helicopter was destroyed. Protect it until all four reach the departure
        zone.
    - key: mission.m04.result.carrier_lost
      value: The APC was lost before the team completed the transfer.
    - key: mission.m04.result.defeat
      value: EXTRACTION FAILED
    - key: mission.m04.result.earned
      value: EARNED
    - key: mission.m04.result.escort_lost
      value: The escort was lost. Keep at least one rifle soldier alive until departure.
    - key: mission.m04.result.extract
      value: Specialists rescued
    - key: mission.m04.result.failure
      value: Extraction failed. Review the passenger and transport status, then retry.
    - key: mission.m04.result.integrity
      value: The rescue roster could not be verified. Retry the operation.
    - key: mission.m04.result.landing
      value: 20-second LZ clearance
    - key: mission.m04.result.missed
      value: NOT EARNED
    - key: mission.m04.result.objectives
      value: RESCUE OBJECTIVES
    - key: mission.m04.result.passenger_lost
      value: A specialist was lost. Keep all four protected during boarding and transfer.
    - key: mission.m04.result.rescued_stat
      value: SPECIALISTS RESCUED
    - key: mission.m04.result.star.complete
      value: Rescue all four
    - key: mission.m04.result.star.escort
      value: No escort losses
    - key: mission.m04.result.star.time
      value: Under 7 minutes
    - key: mission.m04.result.star_objectives
      value: STAR OBJECTIVES
    - key: mission.m04.result.subtitle
      value: "AIRLIFT \xB7 MEDICAL LANDING ZONE"
    - key: mission.m04.result.success
      value: All four specialists reached safety by APC and helicopter. Captain Laila
        Nasser joins the campaign.
    - key: mission.m04.result.timeout
      value: The ten-minute extraction window closed before departure.
    - key: mission.m04.result.transport
      value: Transport protection
    - key: mission.m04.result.victory
      value: EXTRACTION COMPLETE
    - key: mission.m04.reward.card
      value: 500 XP | 2,500 CREDITS | LAILA | TRANSPORT
    - key: mission.m04.reward.laila
      value: Captain Laila Nasser joins
    - key: mission.m04.reward.transport
      value: Transport access
    - key: mission.m04.specialist.description
      value: Rescue passenger. Keep all four specialists safe.
    - key: mission.m04.specialist.group
      value: '{0} SPECIALISTS'
    - key: mission.m04.specialist.name
      value: Specialist
    - key: mission.m04.specialist.role
      value: Rescue passenger
    - key: mission.m04.star.1
      value: All four extracted
    - key: mission.m04.star.2
      value: No escort losses
    - key: mission.m04.star.3
      value: Finish within 7 minutes
    - key: mission.m04.summary
      value: Rescue four specialists by APC, then escort their helicopter out.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.1.body
      value: 'Rescue all four specialists: APC first, helicopter second. You have
        ten minutes. Enemy kills are optional; keep the escort alive for a bonus
        star.'
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.1.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.1.example
      value: Read the route, then continue.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.1.mistake
      value: Do not leave a specialist behind.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.1.title
      value: A rescue, in two stages
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.10.body
      value: Keep the loaded helicopter inside the marked landing area for twenty
        clear seconds. Use the rifles to stop threats entering the ring. Leaving
        or enemy entry resets the count.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.10.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.10.example
      value: Wait for Laila's departure clearance.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.10.mistake
      value: Taking off early does not award extraction progress.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.10.title
      value: Hold the landing area clear
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.11.body
      value: Select the helicopter, press Move, then tap the marked exit. Show Me
        locates the exit. Keep all four specialists aboard until extraction is confirmed.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.11.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.11.example
      value: Cross the departure area with the helicopter airborne.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.11.mistake
      value: The APC reaching the exit does not count as an airlift.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.11.title
      value: Fly to the departure zone
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.12.body
      value: Extraction is being confirmed. Keep the passengers aboard and protect
        the helicopter until the result appears.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.12.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.12.example
      value: Laila joins the campaign after the first successful extraction.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.12.mistake
      value: Failure never grants rescue rewards or shows a successful departure.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.12.title
      value: Review your rescue
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.2.body
      value: Select the wheeled APC beside your rifles. Keep its four seats free
        for the specialists. Show Me locates the APC.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.2.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.2.example
      value: Select the APC before giving its movement order.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.2.mistake
      value: A selected rifle squad is not the transport.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.2.title
      value: Select the APC
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.3.body
      value: Press Move, then tap beside the four specialists on the western road.
        Show Me locates them. Send the rifles forward to cover the pickup.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.3.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.3.example
      value: The road gives a clear approach for the APC.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.3.mistake
      value: Do not drive through buildings or leave the APC in enemy fire.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.3.title
      value: Reach the stranded team
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.4.body
      value: Select all four specialists beside the road. Keep armed escorts outside
        the selection. This step completes when all four are selected.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.4.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.4.example
      value: Tap Select all specialists in ARIA.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.4.mistake
      value: Keep armed escorts out of this selection.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.4.title
      value: Select the specialists
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.5.body
      value: Press Board, then tap the APC. Wait until its passenger list shows all
        four specialists before moving.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.5.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.5.example
      value: Check the passenger count before moving.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.5.mistake
      value: Moving too soon can leave a passenger walking behind.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.5.title
      value: Board all four into the APC
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.6.body
      value: Move the loaded APC east to the marked landing area. Show Me locates
        Laila. Keep the rifles covering the approaching patrol.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.6.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.6.example
      value: Keep the passenger count at four during the trip.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.6.mistake
      value: Do not leave the escort behind the convoy.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.6.title
      value: Escort the APC to Laila
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.7.body
      value: Open the APC passenger panel, then tap Unload. Wait until all four specialists
        stand beside the helicopter. Move into open ground if unloading is blocked.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.7.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.7.example
      value: Unload close to the helicopter while the rifles cover.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.7.mistake
      value: A rejected unload leaves passengers safely aboard; it does not transfer
        them.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.7.title
      value: Unload beside the helicopter
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.8.body
      value: "Select Laila\u2019s helicopter. Keep it landed beside the specialists
        until all four have boarded."
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.8.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.8.example
      value: Keep it at the landing area until all four are aboard.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.8.mistake
      value: An airborne helicopter cannot instantly collect a passenger.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.8.title
      value: Inspect the helicopter
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.9.body
      value: Select all four specialists, press Board, then tap the landed helicopter.
        Check that its passenger list shows four people.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.9.diagram
      value: "TEAM \u2192 APC \u2192 LANDING AREA \u2192 HELICOPTER \u2192 EXIT"
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.9.example
      value: Board the team, not the escort rifle squads.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.9.mistake
      value: Flying straight to the team skips the required APC leg and will not
        complete the mission.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.9.title
      value: Transfer the specialists
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.hold.contested
      value: 'Enemy inside the landing ring: the safety timer has reset. Keep the
        helicopter here. Select your armed escorts and attack the intruders; the
        countdown resumes when the ring is clear.'
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.hold.return
      value: The helicopter is outside the landing zone. Select it, press Move, then
        tap inside the yellow landing ring. Keep it there until the safety countdown
        finishes.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.hold.wait
      value: All four specialists are aboard. Wait {0} more seconds; no click is
        needed. Keep the helicopter inside the yellow landing ring. The next lesson
        will guide you to the exit.
    - key: mission.m04.tutorial.selection_progress
      value: 'Specialists selected: {0}/4. Tap Select all specialists to select the
        rescue team together. Once all four are selected, follow the next highlighted
        action.'
    - key: mission.m05.access
      value: "8 rifles \xB7 heavy APC"
    - key: mission.m05.camera.opening
      value: "ASSAULT ROUTE \xB7 Gate \u2192 transmitter \u2192 archive"
    - key: mission.m05.camera.victory
      value: "ARCHIVE RECOVERED \xB7 Protocol Fragment One secured"
    - key: mission.m05.compound.archive
      value: Archive
    - key: mission.m05.compound.gate
      value: Relay Gate
    - key: mission.m05.compound.guard_post
      value: Guard Post
    - key: mission.m05.compound.wall
      value: Concrete Perimeter
    - key: mission.m05.enemy_intel
      value: Garrison infantry; reinforcements respond 15 seconds after the gate
        takes damage.
    - key: mission.m05.guide.availability.0
      value: Friendly in M5
    - key: mission.m05.guide.availability.1
      value: Hostile in M5
    - key: mission.m05.guide.availability.2
      value: Protected civilian in M5
    - key: mission.m05.guide.availability.3
      value: "Reference only \xB7 unavailable in M5"
    - key: mission.m05.guide.title
      value: "FIELD GUIDE \xB7 BREACH ASSAULT"
    - key: mission.m05.hud.counterattack
      value: Enemy reinforcements in {0}s
    - key: mission.m05.hud.recovery.complete
      value: Archive recovered. Mission complete.
    - key: mission.m05.hud.recovery.enemies
      value: Recovery is blocked by enemies. Defeat the remaining guards, then keep
        a unit inside the archive area for 20 seconds.
    - key: mission.m05.hud.recovery.enter
      value: Move at least one unit into the marked archive area to start the 20-second
        recovery.
    - key: mission.m05.hud.recovery.progress
      value: 'Recovering the archive: {0} seconds left. Keep at least one unit inside
        the marked area. Leaving resets recovery.'
    - key: mission.m05.hud.recovery.reinforcements
      value: Enemy reinforcements are approaching. Defeat them before archive recovery
        can begin.
    - key: mission.m05.hud.status
      value: "Archive {0}/{3}s \xB7 Guards {1} \xB7 {2} remaining"
    - key: mission.m05.location
      value: "Eastern district \xB7 fortified relay"
    - key: mission.m05.name
      value: BREACH ASSAULT
    - key: mission.m05.objective.archive
      value: Secure the archive for 20 seconds
    - key: mission.m05.objective.archive.body
      value: Defeat all guards and hold the marked area for 20 seconds.
    - key: mission.m05.objective.core
      value: Disable the transmitter
    - key: mission.m05.objective.core.body
      value: After the breach, destroy the marked satellite transmitter.
    - key: mission.m05.objective.gate
      value: Breach the compound gate
    - key: mission.m05.objective.gate.body
      value: Attack the marked gate to open the entrance into the base.
    - key: mission.m05.options
      value: Breach together; preserve the armor; recover the records
    - key: mission.m05.resources
      value: Mission-supplied heavy APC; no construction required
    - key: mission.m05.result.chapter
      value: CHAPTER ONE COMPLETE
    - key: mission.m05.result.defeat
      value: ASSAULT FAILED
    - key: mission.m05.result.loss
      value: The assault force was lost. Retry with the rifles supporting the APC.
    - key: mission.m05.result.lost
      value: LOST
    - key: mission.m05.result.setup
      value: The assault could not be prepared. Retry the mission.
    - key: mission.m05.result.success
      value: The relay is silent. Protocol Fragment One is secured.
    - key: mission.m05.result.support
      value: HEAVY APC
    - key: mission.m05.result.survived
      value: SURVIVED
    - key: mission.m05.result.timeout
      value: The archive was erased. Retry and reach the relay before twelve minutes.
    - key: mission.m05.result.unit_losses
      value: ASSAULT UNITS LOST
    - key: mission.m05.result.victory
      value: FIRST RESPONSE COMPLETE
    - key: mission.m05.reward.armor
      value: APC armor parts
    - key: mission.m05.reward.card
      value: 750 XP | 4,000 CREDITS | RECON | 35 ARMOR PARTS
    - key: mission.m05.reward.ghillie
      value: Ghillie reconnaissance team
    - key: mission.m05.star.1
      value: Recover the archive
    - key: mission.m05.star.2
      value: Heavy APC survives
    - key: mission.m05.star.3
      value: Finish under 9 minutes
    - key: mission.m05.summary
      value: Breach the relay gate, silence its transmitter, and recover the archive.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.1.body
      value: Break the gate, destroy the transmitter, then secure the archive for
        20 seconds. You have 12 minutes. Keep the APC alive and finish under 9 minutes
        for bonus stars.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.1.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.1.example
      value: Press Continue when ready.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.1.mistake
      value: The APC is a bonus objective, not your only way to win.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.1.title
      value: Read the assault plan
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.2.body
      value: Select the heavy APC. If it is lost, use a surviving rifle squad. Show
        Me marks the unit to select.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.2.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.2.example
      value: Tap the marked unit.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.2.mistake
      value: Orders require a selected friendly unit.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.2.title
      value: Select your assault unit
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.3.body
      value: Press Attack, then tap the marked enemy gate. Wait for it to fall. Show
        Me follows your next required click.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.3.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.3.example
      value: Keep the APC supported by the rifles.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.3.mistake
      value: Move orders do not attack the gate.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.3.title
      value: Breach the road gate
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.body
      value: Select your rifles, press Move, and tap the marked approach beyond the
        gate. Keep the team together; enemy reinforcements are responding.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.example
      value: Move into the open area by the relay.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.fallback
      value: Your rifles are lost. Select the surviving APC, press Move, then tap
        the marked approach beyond the gate.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.mistake
      value: Do not leave the rifles behind while armor fights alone.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.4.title
      value: Bring the team through
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.5.body
      value: Select a friendly unit, press Attack, then tap the marked satellite
        transmitter. Destroying it opens the archive objective.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.5.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.5.example
      value: Concentrate fire on the marked transmitter.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.5.mistake
      value: Focus on the marked transmitter inside the compound.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.5.title
      value: Silence the transmitter
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.6.body
      value: Attack the remaining guards. Show Me marks a live enemy. You must defeat
        the garrison and its reinforcements before securing the archive.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.6.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.6.example
      value: Use the APC and rifles together.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.6.mistake
      value: The archive cannot be secured while the guard is still active.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.6.title
      value: Stop the counterattack
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.7.body
      value: Select a surviving unit, press Move, then tap the marked archive area.
        Keep at least one unit there while the records are recovered.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.7.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.7.example
      value: The secure timer starts when the area is clear.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.7.mistake
      value: Leaving the area resets the twenty-second hold.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.7.title
      value: Reach the archive
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.8.body
      value: Hold the archive area for 20 uninterrupted seconds. Keep a survivor
        in the marked area until ARIA confirms recovery.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.8.diagram
      value: "GATE \u2192 TRANSMITTER \u2192 ARCHIVE"
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.8.example
      value: Wait for the recovery confirmation.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.8.mistake
      value: A destroyed transmitter alone does not complete the mission.
    - key: mission.m05.tutorial.8.title
      value: Recover the archive
    - key: mission.reward.commander_xp
      value: COMMANDER XP
    - key: mission.reward.credits
      value: CREDITS
