      value: "CONTINUE   \u203A"
    - key: narrative.first_launch.language.info
      value: 'This can be changed later

        in Command Settings.'
    - key: narrative.first_launch.language.title
      value: SELECT STORY LANGUAGE
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p02_radio
      value: Multiple explosions reported across Old Market. Power is failing. The
        main road to the clinic is blocked.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p03_radio
      value: Joint Response Command, this is District Dispatch. Do you copy? The
        district relay is down. The command channel has gone silent.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p04_dalia
      value: District Dispatch, Major Dalia Rahim, JRC Field Command. We found the
        convoy survivors. Extraction is underway.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p04_samira
      value: Field Command, this is Engineer Samira Haddad with Civil Infrastructure.
        Families and road crews are trapped beyond the clinic route.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p05_aria
      value: I'm ARIA, the Civic Relay assistant. Relay integrity is degraded. Command
        channels remain offline.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p06_aria
      value: Emergency continuity protocol is now active. One verified command authority
        remains.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p07_aria
      value: Old Market is the immediate priority. Armed units are closing in on
        the blocked clinic route.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p09_aria
      value: Commander identity confirmed. I will provide tactical support. You retain
        command authority.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p10_aria
      value: 'The failures were deliberate: power, roads, then command.'
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p11_dalia
      value: Two JRC squads still active. The nearest forward post has gone dark.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p12_samira
      value: Civilians, clinic staff, and municipal crews are still trapped beyond
        the roadblock.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p13_aria
      value: We do not yet have enough evidence to identify who is behind the attack.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p14_commander
      value: Link the response teams. Secure the clinic corridor. Confirm targets
        before engaging.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p15_dalia
      value: Confirmed. Armed Ash Line patrol approaching Old Market. No heavy weapons
        observed.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p16_aria
      value: Three armed hostiles confirmed. Civilians are still behind the barriers.
        Engage only within the marked corridor.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p17_dalia
      value: Field units standing by. You have tactical control, Commander.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.line.p18_aria
      value: Select the rifle squad. Move them into cover. Secure the corridor.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.location.old_market.context
      value: OLD MARKET / 10:00 LOCAL
    - key: narrative.first_launch.location.sahrin.name
      value: SAHRIN
    - key: narrative.first_launch.skip.body
      value: The default commander identity and Full Guidance setting will be used.
        You can change both later.
    - key: narrative.first_launch.skip.title
      value: SKIP TO TACTICAL COMMAND?
    - key: narrative.first_launch.speaker.aria.accessible_label
      value: ARIA, CIVIC RELAY ASSISTANT
    - key: narrative.first_launch.speaker.aria.name
      value: ARIA
    - key: narrative.first_launch.speaker.aria.role
      value: CIVIC RELAY ASSISTANT
