    - key: skirmish.s002.brief
      value: Use the starting tank and APC to contest the highway. Keep one infantry squad at home. Press now or scout the south sweep before siege.
    - key: skirmish.s002.objective
      value: Destroy the original enemy Barracks while your original Barracks survives.
    - key: skirmish.s002.result.defeat
      value: Your main base was destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s002.result.draw_bases
      value: Both original bases were destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s002.result.draw_deadline
      value: Time expired with both original bases standing.
    - key: skirmish.s002.result.surrender
      value: Surrender accepted.
    - key: skirmish.s002.result.victory
      value: Enemy main base destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s002.title
      value: Desert Base · Base Assault · Established
    - key: skirmish.s002.warning.offensive_air
      value: Ground Maneuver cannot queue attack helicopters or jets.
    - key: skirmish.s002.warning.replacement_base
      value: A replacement Barracks is not the designated victory base.
    - key: skirmish.s003.brief
      value: Hold a light ground screen and contest the highway. Build Helipad before you commit attack helicopters. Escort an APC push or transition to air while you guard supply.
    - key: skirmish.s003.objective
      value: Destroy the original enemy Barracks while your original Barracks survives.
    - key: skirmish.s003.result.defeat
      value: Your main base was destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s003.result.draw_bases
      value: Both original bases were destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s003.result.draw_deadline
      value: Time expired with both original bases standing.
    - key: skirmish.s003.result.surrender
      value: Surrender accepted.
    - key: skirmish.s003.result.victory
      value: Enemy main base destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s003.title
      value: Desert Base · Base Assault · Air Mobile · Field
    - key: skirmish.s003.warning.offensive_air
      value: Field Base cannot queue attack helicopters or jets until Helipad or Airport and matching readiness are ready.
    - key: skirmish.s003.warning.replacement_base
      value: A replacement Barracks is not the designated victory base.
    - key: skirmish.s004.brief
      value: Scout with infantry and the starting transport helicopter. AA covers the staging area. Lift infantry toward the north ruins, or build offensive air while a ground reserve stays home.
    - key: skirmish.s004.objective
      value: Destroy the original enemy Barracks while your original Barracks survives.
    - key: skirmish.s004.result.defeat
      value: The original player Barracks is destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s004.result.draw_bases
      value: Both original Barracks were destroyed on the same tick.
    - key: skirmish.s004.result.draw_deadline
      value: Both original Barracks were still standing at the deadline.
    - key: skirmish.s004.result.surrender
      value: Surrender accepted.
    - key: skirmish.s004.result.victory
      value: The original enemy Barracks is destroyed.
    - key: skirmish.s004.title
      value: Desert Base · Base Assault · Air Mobile · Established Base
    - key: skirmish.s004.warning.offensive_air
      value: Established Air Mobile can queue attack helicopters from the granted Helipad. Jets and the transport plane still need an Airport and Full Arsenal. Tanks, heavy APCs, and ground siege are not in this army.
    - key: skirmish.s004.warning.replacement_base
      value: A replacement Barracks does not replace the original main base.
