      value: FOG OF WAR
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.1.body
      value: Destroy the marked enemy Main Base and protect your own. Extra Barracks
        do not replace your Main Base. If neither base falls before the clock expires,
        the match is a draw.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.1.diagram
      value: "Protect your base \u2192 break the defenses \u2192 destroy the enemy
        base"
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.1.example
      value: Tap YOUR BASE or ENEMY BASE above the battlefield to find it. Use the
        map to plan your approach.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.1.mistake
      value: You do not need to destroy every enemy or supply building. The marked
        Main Base is the objective.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.1.title
      value: WIN THE MATCH
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.2.body
      value: Tap a squad card to select that group. Tap Move, then the ground to
        choose a destination. Tap Attack, then an enemy. Hold keeps the group in
        position while it fights enemies in range.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.2.diagram
      value: "Squad card \u2192 command \u2192 destination or enemy"
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.2.example
      value: Gather your groups outside enemy range, then attack together. Remove
        a defending Watchtower before attacking the base.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.2.mistake
      value: Move is a travel order. Sending a group into enemy fire before giving
        Attack can cost soldiers.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.2.title
      value: SELECT AND COMMAND
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.3.body
      value: Open Build to add defenses or recruit rifle soldiers. Buildings need
        clear ground away from roads and sidewalks. Move or rotate the preview until
        it is green, then confirm. Accepted recruitment closes Build and joins your
        squad cards when ready.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.3.diagram
      value: "Build \u2192 choose item \u2192 check cost and space \u2192 confirm"
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.3.example
      value: The infantry counter shows your limit. Build defenses near your base,
        then spend Materials on replacements.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.3.mistake
      value: Rejected orders do not spend resources. Read the cost or capacity message
        before trying again.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.3.title
      value: BUILD AND REINFORCE
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.4.body
      value: Trucks deliver Oil automatically. The fabrication depot turns delivered
        Oil into Materials; the refinery supplies usable Fuel. Protect the trucks
        and supply buildings. Replace a lost structure through Build if you can afford
        it.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.4.diagram
      value: "Oil pump \u2192 cargo delivery \u2192 Materials or Fuel"
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.4.example
      value: If Materials stop increasing, check that your Oil pump, cargo trucks
        and fabrication depot are still working.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.4.mistake
      value: Oil waiting at a source is not delivered supply. Keep routes open and
        allow the trucks time to complete the trip.
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.4.title
      value: KEEP SUPPLY MOVING
    - key: ui.skirmish.guide.title
      value: BASE ASSAULT FIELD GUIDE
