    - key: unit.apc.fast.description
      value: Fast armored personnel carrier for quickly transporting infantry across
        the battlefield.
    - key: unit.description.chr_bombsuit_male_01
      value: Armored explosive-ordnance specialist. Slow but durable unit intended
        for hazardous objectives and high-risk pushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_civilian_female_01
      value: Non-combatant female civilian. Can be targeted manually but does not
        automatically engage enemies.
    - key: unit.description.chr_civilian_male_01
      value: Non-combatant male civilian. Can be targeted manually but does not automatically
        engage enemies.
    - key: unit.description.chr_contractor_female_01
      value: Private close-protection specialist armed with a SMG. Flexible support
        unit for base security and patrol work.
    - key: unit.description.chr_contractor_male_01
      value: Private sidearm security guard armed with a pistol. Flexible support
        unit for base security and patrol work.
    - key: unit.description.chr_contractor_male_02
      value: Private contract rifleman armed with a rifle. Flexible support unit
        for base security and patrol work.
    - key: unit.description.chr_ghillie_male_01
      value: Concealed heavy-weapons operator armed with a rocket launcher. Best
        used for ambushes against vehicles and fortified targets.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_female_01
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with a rifle. Built for asymmetric attacks
        and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_female_02
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with a pistol. Built for asymmetric
        attacks and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_male_01
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with an RPG. Built for asymmetric attacks
        and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_male_02
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with a machine gun. Built for asymmetric
        attacks and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_male_03
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with a SMG. Built for asymmetric attacks
        and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_insurgent_male_04
      value: Hostile irregular fighter armed with a sniper rifle. Built for asymmetric
        attacks and defensive ambushes.
    - key: unit.description.chr_leader_male_01
      value: Command unit armed with a metal pistol. Provides a high-value leadership
        presence for coordinated infantry operations.
    - key: unit.description.chr_pilot_male_01
      value: Aircraft crew member armed with a compact pistol. Lightly equipped personnel
        for aviation-related operations.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.0
      value: Regular soldier armed with a rifle. Reliable frontline infantry for
        patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.1
      value: Regular soldier armed with a sniper rifle. Reliable frontline infantry
        for patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.2
      value: Regular soldier armed with a SMG. Reliable frontline infantry for patrols,
        defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.3
      value: Regular soldier armed with a machine gun. Reliable frontline infantry
        for patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.4
      value: Regular soldier armed with an advanced rifle. Reliable frontline infantry
        for patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.5
      value: Regular soldier armed with a pistol. Reliable frontline infantry for
        patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.soldier.6
      value: Regular soldier armed with a metal pistol. Reliable frontline infantry
        for patrols, defense, and direct engagements.
    - key: unit.description.veh_apc_heavy
      value: Heavy armored personnel carrier with stronger protection for moving
        squads under fire.
    - key: unit.description.veh_apc_slow
      value: Durable armored personnel carrier designed to safely transport infantry
        to the front line.
    - key: unit.description.veh_drone
      value: Light unmanned aircraft for scouting, patrol support, and fast battlefield
        awareness.
    - key: unit.description.veh_helicopter_attack
      value: Armed helicopter built for rapid strike missions and close air support.
    - key: unit.description.veh_helicopter_attack_small
      value: Agile attack helicopter for quick response, harassment, and light air
        support.
    - key: unit.description.veh_jet_01
      value: Fast combat aircraft for precision attacks and high-speed battlefield
        response.
    - key: unit.description.veh_jet_02
      value: Advanced jet aircraft for air superiority and rapid strike operations.
    - key: unit.description.veh_light_armored_car
      value: Mobile armored vehicle for patrols, flanking maneuvers, and fast fire
        support.
    - key: unit.description.veh_missle_launcher_air
      value: Ground-to-air missile launcher for defending bases against helicopters,
        drones, and jets.
    - key: unit.description.veh_missle_launcher_ground
      value: Long-range ground-to-ground cruise missile launcher for enemy bases
        and fortified targets.
    - key: unit.description.veh_plane_transport
      value: Heavy aircraft used to deliver requested units and equipment to the
        airfield.
    - key: unit.description.veh_tank_usa
      value: Main battle tank with heavy armor and strong firepower for frontline
        engagements.
    - key: unit.description.veh_truck_canopy
      value: Carries ammunition supplies or transports soldiers as a light APC-style
        personnel carrier.
    - key: unit.description.veh_truck_tanker
      value: Transports fuel to Building_Fuel_Bladder or refuels vehicles directly
        in the field.
    - key: unit.description.veh_truck_tray
      value: Transports oil barrels from pumps and storage points to refinery or
        base resource destinations.
    - key: unit.helicopter.transport.description
      value: Transport helicopter that lands for boarding and deploys soldiers by
        rope while airborne.
